  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "SunBehaviour is a sophisticated EntityBehaviour responsible for simulating the celestial mechanics of a day/night cycle within the game engine. It dynamically controls the primary directional light (sun) position, color, and intensity based on an internal time-of-day clock. It interfaces with the SkyboxRenderer to update atmospheric visuals, managing transitions between sunrise, noon, and night phases while optionally controlling a secondary moon light source."
  },
